# Regime-diversity backfill, 2026-08-02. The roster had ZERO agents from two
# training regimes that the codebase supports and that had been run: models
# distilled from a fixed heuristic teacher (teacher_games) and self-distillation
# chains (model_games). These 8 fill that gap. Same rule as slots 94..99: cited
# by hash from ranking/roster.txt, so they must travel with the repo.
# teacher_games -- Classic teacher at d2 / d4 / d6, plus a diluted-d2 variant:
!models/sweep/slot700.txt
!models/sweep/slot701.txt
!models/sweep/slot702.txt
